# .claudeignore — exclude historical/transient artifacts from Claude Code session-open context load
# Per token-optimization.md v0.3 §9.5 (Phase 4) + B_TOKEN_BUDGET R1 (default depth L1; on-demand only)
# Engraved S007 turn 6 — files matching these patterns are NOT loaded by default; explicit Read still works.

# === Historical session artifacts (point-in-time records; load on-demand only) ===
# Per naming-policy Rule 2 (per-session = immutable historical). S001-S005 closing-summaries
# and governor-prompts are reference-only after S006+; current session's logs always loaded.
docs/plan/_handoff/VAULT/qc-audit-results-S00*.md
docs/plan/_handoff/VAULT/validation-pass-S00*.md
docs/plan/_handoff/VAULT/blockers-S00*.md
docs/plan/_handoff/VAULT/gaps-and-duplications-S00*.md

# === Intake processed (extraction artifacts; load on-demand via EXT-ID) ===
# Per ADR-0023 exempt list. raw.md is verbatim copy of external content; provenance/scan-passed
# are auto-generated markers. Frontmatter applies to PARENT extraction-note in canonical processed/.
_intake/processed/*/raw.md
_intake/processed/*/provenance.md
_intake/processed/*/scan-passed.md

# === Auto-generated transient files ===
tools/verify-last-run.md
tools/bootstrap-readiness.md

# === AGENTS.md backup (reference; not active rules) ===
AGENTS.md.original

# === Standard exclusions (defensive; Claude Code may already ignore) ===
node_modules/
.git/
.next/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo

# === Logs + temp ===
*.log
.DS_Store
tmp/
.cache/

# Note: per B_TOKEN_BUDGET R5, full file content is on-demand. Excluded files remain accessible
# via explicit Read tool; this file only governs auto-context-load at session-open.
